WEBVTT

00:05:56.596 --> 00:06:00.796
And going further, as we walk, we realize

00:06:00.836 --> 00:06:06.956
that we embody millions
of years of evolution.

00:06:09.316 --> 00:06:15.076
Each one of us is nothing less
than a representative of the planet.

00:06:15.116 --> 00:06:17.236
A child of the Earth.

00:06:19.716 --> 00:06:22.716
In this very moment,

00:06:22.716 --> 00:06:29.036
we are all made of Earth, sun and stars.

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:35.396
Mountains and rivers,
savannahs and rainforests.